        "accordion_e36ENy": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions – SIHOO Doro C100</strong><br/><strong><br/>1. What makes the SIHOO Doro C100 unique in its class?</strong><br/>The Doro C100 stands out for its high-performance ergonomic design, providing advanced comfort at an accessible price. It’s engineered for all-day support—perfect for office workers, students, and home office setups across Australia.<br/><br/><strong>2. How does the lumbar support work in the Doro C100?</strong><br/>The Doro C100 features a dynamic lumbar support system that automatically responds to your movements, gently supporting your lower back throughout the day. No manual adjustments are needed—just sit back and enjoy continuous comfort.<br/><br/><strong>3. Is the Doro C100 suitable for taller users?</strong><br/>Yes! The Doro C100 is designed to comfortably accommodate users from 152 cm to 190 cm, providing excellent ergonomic alignment for a wide range of heights and body types.<br/><br/><strong>4. Does the Doro C100 have an adjustable headrest?</strong><br/>Absolutely. The independent headrest allows for both height and angle adjustments, giving you tailored neck and head support—whether you’re working, studying, gaming, or simply relaxing.<br/><br/><strong>5. What armrest features does the Doro C100 offer?</strong><br/>The Doro C100 is equipped with multi-directional armrests (4D) that move up and down, forwards and backwards, and inwards/outwards. This flexibility ensures your arms and shoulders stay comfortable no matter how you’re sitting.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/><strong>Why choose SIHOO Doro C100?</strong><br/>\t•\tDynamic lumbar support for healthier posture<br/>\t•\tAdjustable headrest for personalised comfort<br/>\t•\tVersatile 4D armrests<br/>\t•\tIdeal for Australian homes and offices<br/><br/>Whether you’re setting up your home workspace or upgrading your office chair, the SIHOO Doro C100 delivers all-day comfort and support for every user.<br/></p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
