        },
        "text_g8qqFy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Dynamic lumbar support that moves with you</h3><p>The BM (Body Movement) Tracking System of Sihoo Doro C100 guarantees that the lumbar support of this <a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\">ergonomic office chair</a> adjusts itself to the contours of your spine, ensuring both comfort and support for your back in various positions, all without requiring any manual adjustments.</p>",
