        "text_R4je3R": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Made for comfort, made to last</h4><p>Sihoo Doro-C100 features a top-notch mesh design that promotes airflow, preventing any discomfort from sweating or feeling sticky. Additionally, it boasts a stylish and contemporary appearance, effortless cleaning, and exceptional durability for long-lasting use.</p>",
