          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Adaptable mechanism, comfortable reclining",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_7jFwg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Adaptable mechanism, comfortable reclining</h4><p>By utilizing weight-sensing and mechanical conduction advancements, Sihoo Doro-C100's mechanism adapts to your body weight and movements, enabling a seamless and balanced sitting and reclining experience that is both comfortable and effortless.</p>",
