        "text_GzqmXR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Rest your arms in 4 directions and in coordination</h4><p>Doro C100 comes equipped with cushioned and supple 4-directional armrests that offer versatile adjustments – up and down, back and forth, and even pivot up to 75 degrees. Moreover, these armrests are synchronized with the seatback when reclining, providing an ideal solution for comfortably resting your arms in different positions while you work.</p>",
